      "statement": "The .husky/commit-msg hook runs commitlint (format validation via commitlint.config.cjs) followed by scripts/commit-type-guard.mjs (file-path-based type validation), while .husky/pre-commit is intentionally empty with only a commented-out `pnpm test`.",
